 R←Test_52(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;H;state;count;full;byTime;fulls;byTimes;signature;ceiling;resetAfter;repeatAfter;t0;hour
⍝ `StormRule`: with `stormRepeatAfter` 1, an error that occurs once an hour gets the full treatment every time
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 H←##.HandleError
 state←H.NewStormState
 signature←'11 Foo[6]'
 ceiling←100
 resetAfter←24
 repeatAfter←1
 t0←1000000
 fulls←⍬
 byTimes←⍬
 :For hour :In ¯1+⍳10
     (state count full byTime)←H.StormRule state signature(t0+3600×hour)ceiling resetAfter repeatAfter
     fulls,←full
     byTimes,←byTime
 :EndFor

 →T.GoToTidyUp fulls≢10⍴1
 →T.GoToTidyUp byTimes≢0 0,8⍴1                       ⍝ Occurrences 1 and 2 qualify by their count
 →T.GoToTidyUp(,10)≢state.lastFulls

 R←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
